	"notice": "Joystick pitch control applies when its axis is configured for Pitch Bend. Pad, knob and joystick CC assignments depend on the selected preset; no fixed CC numbers are assumed. These controls perform MIDI into the chain; they do not edit the hardware preset. Configurable surface controls use virtual defaults; match your hardware preset with MIDI learn or edit note/CC/channel mappings. Keyboard surfaces start at MIDI note 48.",
